{"id":"50076d54977c5fd6","group":"18","path":"18/18-thm-collapsing-comparison.md","title":"Cumulativity and Collapse Comparison","display":"thm-collapsing-comparison — Cumulativity and Collapse Comparison","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers","book_abbrev":"18","label":"18-thm-collapsing-comparison","aliases":["18-thm-collapsing-comparison"],"display":"thm-collapsing-comparison — Cumulativity and Collapse Comparison","depends_on":["[[18-df-collapsing-closure]]","[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]]","[[18-df-ordinal]]"],"source_work":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)","source_section":"§9.4 equations (9.18)–(9.21)","source_printed_pages":"173–174","source_pdf_pages":"183–184","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":true,"source_proof_review":"未逐项复核原书证明","content_revision":"2026-10-14","content_review_scope":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Proof Theory — Wolfram Pohlers"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"18"},{"key":"label","html":"18-thm-collapsing-comparison"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>18-thm-collapsing-comparison</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-collapsing-comparison — Cumulativity and Collapse Comparison"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b3f52af2d45c0ea\" href=\"?note=6b3f52af2d45c0ea\" title=\"18-df-collapsing-closure\">18-df-collapsing-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d042b39a8b79bc06\" href=\"?note=d042b39a8b79bc06\" title=\"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function\">18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"cf95026e035bcb2b\" href=\"?note=cf95026e035bcb2b\" title=\"18-df-ordinal\">18-df-ordinal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_work","html":"Proof Theory: The First Step into Impredicativity (Springer, 2009)"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§9.4 equations (9.18)–(9.21)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"173–174"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"183–184"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"true"},{"key":"source_proof_review","html":"未逐项复核原书证明"},{"key":"content_revision","html":"2026-10-14"},{"key":"content_review_scope","html":"local formal-language and dependency review; no proof-assistant verification; no new source-page check"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Omega=\\omega_1\">\\(\\Omega=\\omega_1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"6b3f52af2d45c0ea\" href=\"?note=6b3f52af2d45c0ea\" title=\"18-df-collapsing-closure\">18-df-collapsing-closure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d042b39a8b79bc06\" href=\"?note=d042b39a8b79bc06\" title=\"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function\">18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function</a> 中同时递归定义的类函数。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha\\le\\beta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nC(\\alpha)\\subseteq C(\\beta)\\ \\land\\ \\psi(\\alpha)\\le\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\n\\alpha\\in C(\\beta)\\cap\\beta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\nC(\\alpha)\\cap\\Omega&amp;=\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\Omega.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha\\le\\beta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nC(\\alpha)\\subseteq C(\\beta)\\ \\land\\ \\psi(\\alpha)\\le\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\n\\alpha\\in C(\\beta)\\cap\\beta&amp;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\nC(\\alpha)\\cap\\Omega&amp;=\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\Omega.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>对应原书 (9.18)–(9.21) 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H=B\">\\(H=B\\)</span> 的实例。非降性确实成立；严格不等式另需 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\\in C(\\beta)\\cap\\beta\">\\(\\alpha\\in C(\\beta)\\cap\\beta\\)</span>，不能把 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi\">\\(\\psi\\)</span> 当作严格递增的正规函数。最后的集合等式使用冯·诺伊曼序数：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(\\alpha)\">\\(\\psi(\\alpha)\\)</span> 同时代表其全体前驱。</p>\n<p>可数性保证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\Omega\">\\(\\psi(\\alpha)&lt;\\Omega\\)</span>；闭包包含关系可按有限阶段归纳。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span> 位于受限闭包中时，其像 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\psi(\\alpha)\">\\(\\psi(\\alpha)\\)</span> 也属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C(\\beta)\\cap\\Omega\">\\(C(\\beta)\\cap\\Omega\\)</span>，这给出严格比较。此处已逐项核对原书陈述，未声称复核完整的 Cantorian 算子证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"18-df-collapsing-closure","status":"resolved","id":"6b3f52af2d45c0ea","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-collapsing-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function","status":"resolved","id":"d042b39a8b79bc06","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-ordinal","status":"resolved","id":"cf95026e035bcb2b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[18-df-ordinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-collapsing-closure","status":"resolved","id":"6b3f52af2d45c0ea","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$、$\\psi$ 为 [[18-df-collapsing-closure]]、[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]] 中同时递归定义的类函数。","embed":false},{"target":"18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function","status":"resolved","id":"d042b39a8b79bc06","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$C$、$\\psi$ 为 [[18-df-collapsing-closure]]、[[18-df-buchholz-collapsing-function]] 中同时递归定义的类函数。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\Omega=\\omega_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha,\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\alpha\\le\\beta&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\nC(\\alpha)\\subseteq C(\\beta)\\ \\land\\ \\psi(\\alpha)\\le\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\n\\alpha\\in C(\\beta)\\cap\\beta&\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\psi(\\alpha)<\\psi(\\beta),\\\\\nC(\\alpha)\\cap\\Omega&=\\psi(\\alpha)<\\Omega.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"H=B","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha\\in C(\\beta)\\cap\\beta","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(\\alpha)<\\Omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\alpha","display":false},{"tex":"\\psi(\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"C(\\beta)\\cap\\Omega","display":false}],"bytes":1940,"backlinks":[{"id":"e40f6292323bbb0b","anchor":"ref-122","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[./18-thm-collapsing-comparison]]"},{"id":"1c1dcb6d897f9b41","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","元数据 · canonical_document","正文"],"count":4,"excerpt":"本文件是 [[18-thm-collapsing-comparison]] 的原编号重述入口；所有参数域与该节点相同，下式不引入另一套数学对象或证明关系。"},{"id":"aa6b01d732017d3a","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9a09ccaf5288aab0","anchor":"ref-21","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"严格不等式中，$\\varepsilon_0=\\varphi_1(0)<\\Gamma_0$；由崩塌闭包 $\\psi(0)=\\Gamma_0$、$0\\in C(\\varepsilon_{\\Omega+1})$ 和 [[18-thm-collapsing-comparison]] 的严格比较得到 $\\Gamma_0<\\mathrm{BH}$。本次重核 Corollary 12.7.4 的陈述，并纠正上游误把原书 $\\Delta^1_0$ 算术理解读作 $\\Delta^0_1$ 理解的问题。原书的上界通过嵌入 KPl$_0$ 和 Chapter 12 的归约得到，下界由 Exercise 8.5.32 提供；这里未把这些练习及全部归约重建成闭合的本地推演。故保留现有 reconstruction-pending 与禁止作为已核验证明依赖的状态。"},{"id":"e29d1100705cdb23","anchor":"ref-120","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../18-thm-collapsing-comparison]]"}],"outgoing":["6b3f52af2d45c0ea","d042b39a8b79bc06","cf95026e035bcb2b"]}